All strictly positive: True

HONEST SCOPE: this is still second-order (local, small-angle)
information only, for ONE specific realisation of a chain at
each length (not exhaustive over all induced paths or all
subset topologies), via double-precision finite differences
(Richardson-extrapolated, not exact/symbolic). It extends prior
evidence to the true maximum chain length (8, previously only
tested to 6) and finds no sign of the floor collapsing toward
zero. It does not prove Conjecture (Multi-Direction Positivity)
for any m, and does not address finite (non-infinitesimal) theta.
